# Build outputs and dependencies are recreated inside the images.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/TestResults/

# Not needed by any image
FizzBuzz.UnitTests/
FizzBuzz.IntegrationTests/
**/*.user
**/*.http
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
.git/
.claude/
*.md
compose.yaml
Dockerfile.*

# Never send local secrets to the build context
**/.env
**/*.pfx
**/secrets.json
